  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At the southeast of Meng Zhen immortal aperture, Meng Qiu Zhen creates a lake with little water, hundreds of feet below the nearby shore, like a bowl with a bit of water left at the bottom. That lake water is dream river water. Tongue tip small dream fish live in the same lake.",
      "chapters": [
        2097
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lake-in-meng-zhen",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_meng_qiu_zhen",
        "res_tongue_tip_small_dream_fish"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Dream river water is listed with earth dream fetus hair, nine tune dream flower, tongue tip small dream fish, and dream sand as dream path Gu materials Fang Yuan obtained in that period. Dream path Gu materials were still rare then; after nearly ransacking Southern Border’s underground, he collected only this much. Moved into Meng Zhen immortal aperture, away from surrounding earth path dao marks, they can grow under dream path dao marks and were expected to yield a stream of immortal materials.",
      "chapters": [
        2097
      ],
